abstract: "Complete full-Schmidt-rank equality classification and every two-qudit pure stabilizer ECQC score at odd primes, with sharp global pure ratios for p=1 mod 4 and a general flat-spectrum/rank-gap theorem. Complete written proofs and exact replay programs; not complete Lean formalization."
